items.suggestion:
Change to: "Executes the given `thunk` and then throws an `IllegalStateException` indicating a bug when `parentBlockContext` is null.

@tparam T the type of the result of the `thunk`
@param thunk the computation to execute
@param permission the permission to block
@throws IllegalStateException always, after executing the `thunk`
@return never returns normally"

Change to: "Executes up to `n` `Runnable` tasks from the batch. If the thread is interrupted during execution, an `InterruptedException` may be thrown.

@param n the maximum number of tasks to execute
@throws InterruptedException if the thread is interrupted during execution"

Change to: "Executes the batch of `Runnable` tasks within the given `BlockContext`. Any `Throwable` thrown during execution is returned; otherwise, `null` is returned.

@param prevBlockContext the `BlockContext` to use for blocking operations within the batch
@return any `Throwable` that occurred during execution, or `null` if none occurred"

Change to: "Executes a blocking operation, delegating to the parent `BlockContext`. If tasks are queued in the batch, they are executed immediately to avoid deadlocks.

@tparam T the type of the result of the `thunk`
@param thunk the blocking computation to execute
@param permission the permission to block
@return the result of the `thunk`"
